{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HM0e5SRKa61793696671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波指，上季經濟增長動力持續，政府將密切留意外圍形勢及資金流向，審慎評估各項宏觀變數。</p><p></p><p>財政司司長陳茂波說：「下年經濟增長大家知道，我們每年在預算案中公布，現在政府經濟顧問，我們一直都在收集數據、看數據，同時都要研判外圍形勢，畢竟香港是一個全開放的經濟體。除了說將來的息率相對比較高企之外，大家都覺得未來的不確定性很大，所以我們是很小心謹慎地評估的。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:03:00.826954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.680656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:50.486881+00:00","content_hash":"8159e7cbb48609c1cb74464446b94ba588a56f6d7b74a3f53885fc7515163349","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:03:00.826954+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}